short_description: Manage Oracle online redo log groups and sizes
description:
    - Manage redo log groups and sizes in Standalone and RAC environments.
    - Supports both ASM (OMF) and filesystem storage (auto-discovered or explicit path).
    - Can be run locally on the control machine using python-oracledb thin mode.
version_added: "2.4"
options:
